-- title: Telemetry certificate expiring
-- description: The certificate for the telemetry endpoint expires in under 14 days. Machines cannot send telemetry.
-- severity: Medium
-- host: telemetry-svc.{wildcard_domain}
-- region: all
-- minimum_days_left: 14
-- timeout: 10
-- pending_for: 900
-- resolve_after: 1800
-- runbook_url: https://github.com/frappe/cargo/blob/develop/beacon/runbooks/service-certificate.md
-- Beacon reads the certificate that Caddy serves. Every machine of the region sends its telemetry to this name.
